<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Dear </span><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Blood Program Leader]</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">,</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Thank you for being a part of the American Red Cross Battle
of the Badges program. Together we share
a mission of helping to save lives and we appreciate the opportunity to partner
with </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Contact Organization]</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">. </span><span style="font-size:
12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">You can take pride in knowing that your partnership with us
makes a positive impact on your local community — and those across the country.
Families and communities depend on the Red Cross in times of need; and we
depend on the support of partners, like you, to help fulfill the mission of
saving lives. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Your Heroes Saving Lives blood drive took place on <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Date]</span> and had a goal of <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Units]</span>. You collected a
total of <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[xx]</span> units,
each of which can impact more than one life. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">We rely on blood drive partnerships throughout the year.
Thank you for offering this opportunity to your group to help ensure a safe
national blood supply. We appreciate you and hope we can partner again in the
future. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;background:
yellow;mso-highlight:yellow;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;
mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">[Signature]</span><div><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;background:
yellow;mso-highlight:yellow;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;
mso-bidi-language:AR-SA"><br></span></div><div><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;background:
yellow;mso-highlight:yellow;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;
